<title>USA: EquiMed says seeks damages from Physicians.</title>
<headline>EquiMed says seeks damages from Physicians.</headline>
<dateline>STATE COLLEGE, Pa. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>EquiMed Inc said Wednesday it is seeking $30 million in damages from Physicians Resource Group Inc and PRG Georgia Inc for breach of its October 1996 asset purchase agreement.</p>
<p>EquiMed said it filed a claim before the American Arbitration Association of Philidelphia, Pa. to enforce certain terms of the agreement and recover the damages.</p>
<p>Physicians Resource was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
